{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/c8szka","slide":2,"text":"CORE MESSAGE: The real problem is not verifying a wallet once; it is keeping every later movement eligible.\nAsk the judges: “Should a revoked wallet still be able to send a regulated position?” Pause briefly, then answer: “We believe the answer must be no.”\n[Sources]\n- Internal workspace: product specification, demo script, deployment record (2026-08-03).\n- User-provided Continuum logo.\n[/Sources]"}
